# Glorious Decay, third mode, aimed at Plunder the Trollshaws in Bot2's graveyard. In response Bot2 casts that Plunder from the
# graveyard with flashback (an instant; a card on the stack is a new object, CR 400.7), so the Decay's only target is illegal
# as it tries to resolve and it does not resolve (CR 608.2b, and the ruling): Bot1 draws nothing. Bot1's hand is the cards it
# started with and the turn's draw. Plunder, exiled by its flashback, is in exile; Bot2 drew two cards from it.

